  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESTABLISH A CENTRE OF THE CREATIVE ARTS PROJECT AT EVELYN HONE COLLEGE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to poverty alleviation through supporting the development of innovative vocational education and skills development in the arts.  This will be done through supporting the establishment of a Centre for the Creative Arts at Evelyn Hone College.    Ballyfermot has been recognised as a suitable partner because of its many years of experience in providing vocational education for the arts and culture</narrative>
